# The M9 Hyper-V check's burst-15 run (tools/hyperv/README.md, "At the M9
# check"; docs/design.md, "The M9 Hyper-V check"): m8-release.scenario
# with uart.burst=15 release.flood=32 on the command line. A cap of 15 is
# the burst setup chooses with working FIFOs, as the M8 check found
# Hyper-V's: the control for m9-release-burst1.scenario, whose lines
# differ from these by a digit, with uart writing as in the M8 re-run.
# Root prints 32 numbered lines right after its summary: 2,400 bytes, more
# than uart's 2,048-byte queue, so uart holds console's writes and keeps
# the FIFO fed, as root's summary did when both M8 runs lost bytes. The
# first flood line is expected, the other 31 with next:, each whole, and
# release's line comes right after the last, so a lost byte there fails
# the run; the script then goes on from the next expect:, so the log
# still reaches uart's line and TEST PASS. Lines whole with burst 1 but
# cut with 15 mean Hyper-V's FIFO takes fewer bytes after it reports THRE
# than uart writes; cut either way points at the named pipe. Cut with the
# normal reader but whole with the raw one (-Raw) means the reader fell
# behind; cut with both, Hyper-V's FIFO. The scenario cannot see a cut
# line it does not expect, so the session reads each of root's lines in
# the log. Root's line "root: uart.burst=15: uart's burst capped at 15"
# comes right after its cmdline line, but is not expected, so that bytes
# lost there leave the run going. The release kernel prints nothing; root
# issues no exit port, since this is not QEMU, and halts after TEST PASS;
# the script turns the VM off. The typed line is 14 bytes, whose last 6
# only the character timeout delivers.
cmdline: test=release uart.burst=15 release.flood=32
kernel: release
exit: success
expect: loader: microL4 loader
expect: entering kernel
next: root: microL4 root task
expect: root: cmdline "test=release uart.burst=15 release.flood=32"
expect: root: image frames: slots
expect: root: empty: slots
expect: release: flood 01/32 123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0
next: release: flood 02/32 23456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP01
next: release: flood 03/32 3456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP012
next: release: flood 04/32 456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123
next: release: flood 05/32 56789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP01234
next: release: flood 06/32 6789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP012345
next: release: flood 07/32 789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456
next: release: flood 08/32 89abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP01234567
next: release: flood 09/32 9abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP012345678
next: release: flood 10/32 abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789
next: release: flood 11/32 bcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789a
next: release: flood 12/32 cdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789ab
next: release: flood 13/32 defghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abc
next: release: flood 14/32 efghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcd
next: release: flood 15/32 fghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcde
next: release: flood 16/32 ghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdef
next: release: flood 17/32 hijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefg
next: release: flood 18/32 ijklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefgh
next: release: flood 19/32 jklmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghi
next: release: flood 20/32 klmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghij
next: release: flood 21/32 lmnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghijk
next: release: flood 22/32 mnopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghijkl
next: release: flood 23/32 nopqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghijklm
next: release: flood 24/32 opqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghijklmn
next: release: flood 25/32 pqrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghijklmno
next: release: flood 26/32 qrstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghijklmnop
next: release: flood 27/32 rstuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghijklmnopq
next: release: flood 28/32 stuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqr
next: release: flood 29/32 tuvwxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrs
