next: release: flood 32/32 wxyzABCDEFGHIJKLMNOP0123456789abcdefghijklmnopqrstuv
next: release: watch (priority 255), uart (priority 200) with the COM1 IOPort and IRQ 4, console (priority 150); exit port none: not QEMU
expect: release: a probe thread's DebugPutChar, DebugHalt, DebugDumpScheduler and reserved numbers 19 and 31 each raised UnknownSyscall with the number in MR18
expect: release: type a line
send: release input\r
expect: release: read "release input"
expect: release: uart:
expect: , 14 bytes received,
expect: , 0 overruns, 0 line errors,
expect: , burst 15, # working FIFOs, under the cap
expect: TEST PASS
forbid: microL4 kernel
forbid: bootinfo:
forbid: DEBUG HALT
forbid: KERNEL PANIC
forbid: , 0 THRE bursts
forbid: ignored: not a number
